SAMN08432484	72.0032 14.7205	Atlantic Ocean:Norwegian Sea	1263	2007/6/30	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	marine sediment metagenome : A Genomic Atlas of Anaerobic Methanotrophic (ANME) Archaea	"The anaerobic oxidation of methane is mediated by the syntrophic partnership of anaerobic methanotrophic (ANME) archaea and sulfate reducing bacteria (SRB). There are multiple clades of ANME that have yet to be cultured and to date few ANME species have been analyzed genomically. Here we used a combination of metagenomics and single cell sequencing to recover draft genomes from ANME-1, ANME-2a, ANME-2b, ANME-2c and ANME-3 clades to determine differences in their metabolisms with the goal to understand their niche partitioning in the environment."	PRJNA431796	-	-	SRA654597	-	8432484	SAMN08432484	412755	marine sediment metagenome	-	-	-	-	-	Illumina HiSeq 2000	-	5368006782	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-
