SRR6854294	24.46 N 118.1 E	China: Xiamen	-	27-Feb-2016	2018-03-19T00:00:00.000	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	Metagenomic sequencing of heterotrophic bacteria:Synechococcus sp XM-24 during decay period	-	SRP141386	PRJNA445564	5246651	SRA667478	SRS3060145	8731213	SAMN08731213	408172	marine metagenome	-	Synechococcus culture from coastal marine water	-	-	-	Illumina MiSeq	589013608	889362646	XM-24_decay	WGS	METAGENOMIC	RANDOM	PAIRED	Genome sequencing and assembly	Environment	Genome	Whole	marine metagenome...:Synechococcus and Synechococcus-associated heterotrophic bacteria genome sequencing	Isolated Synechococcus cultures frequently contain associated heterotrophic bacteria, and present a good and relevant research system to investigate the interactions of photoautotrophs-heterotrophs. Metagenomic sequences from microbial community co-cultured with a Synechococcus XM-24.
