SRR1313734	34.39225 N 119.845662 W	USA: Coal Oil Point, Santa Barbara, California	47m	not collected	2014-06-02T00:00:00.000	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	-	Metagenomics of marine metagenome	Oil seeps ecosystem from Coal Oil Point, Santa Barbara, California, USA - Sample 1.	SRP042629	PRJNA249576	800112	SRA168421	SRS624507	2809796	SAMN02809796	408172	marine metagenome	Oil polluted marine water	-	Marine	Water	-	Illumina HiSeq 2000	35534523455	51797214900	PSAC	WGS	METAGENOMIC	RANDOM	PAIRED NOMINAL_LENGTH="408000"	Metagenome	Environment	Genome	Whole	marine metagenome...:Oil polluted marine microbial communities from Coal Oil Point, Santa Barbara, California, USA - Sample 1 Metagenome	Metagenomic analysis of microbial communities associated with natural oils that seep into the Santa Barbara Channel: creating a mechanistic model for biological hydrocarbon-degradation.
